WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.810
Then a worker rolls
non-skid paint on the

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.720
inside so it won't
become slick when wet.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.530
They bring in
incandescent heat lamps

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.960
and the paint dries
quickly in the warm glow.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.810
After just 30 minutes,
the paint is dry.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.600
Then it's time to see if
it'll float.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:24.910
They transfer the
aluminum canoe to a tank

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:28.270
of water. They clamp a
bar across the canoe to

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:31.810
apply 450kg of pressure,
more than the weight of

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.840
two people. They check
for leaks, especially

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:35.950
around the rivets.

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:37.540
There are none.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.520
Crossbars and bench
seating complete the

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:46.430
fabrication. There's one
last bit of business, and

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:51.580
that's the company
insignia. This aluminum

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:52.870
canoe is now ready for
recreation.

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:56.230
Ten hours in the making.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:57.640
The fun has only just
begun.

